  "description_html": "This is a simple edit of the v_9mmar model to be more consistent with the world model.<br>The edit of the model was made in order to fix a small personal nitpick of mine about the<br>inconsistency between the view model and the world model.<br><br>Credits go to <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/members/1398907\">Slartibarty</a> for the <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/skins/140466\">fixed arm model</a><br><br>Rest of the credits go to Valve and Gearbox for the assets.<br><br>Other arm models for this include: HD HEV, MD HEV, LD HEV on gearbox animations, and Half-Life: ECHOES arms.<br><br>There's also classic style animations available for all arms!<br>",
